// Title: VM count per size
// Purpose: Quick view of how the VM estate is spread over sizes (right-sizing and reservation planning).
// Source table(s): Azure Resource Graph, resources (microsoft.compute/virtualmachines)
// Parameters to edit: none.
// Notes/traps: counts all VMs including deallocated ones. For running-only inventory used for
//          reservations see ResourceGraph/Cost/vm-running-inventory-for-reservations.kql.
resources
| where type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines'
| summarize vms = count() by vmSize = tostring(properties.hardwareProfile.vmSize)
| order by vms desc
